&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 的这个能长久存活：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/etE1rY9SxfKWWfAB2LhLwewc-2W2Fb5kV3JRewFkQS_xr37neCpT-r8q9xmMEOhGYsAWIaD7hpx3Jx6RW1XRxCk9JV02uQ8wAJhUiI7E_NdFKsN8tsJ4UMJZS36DePiBI4a2rotwEM0Sn6lOuQ3ia0m0OmOQInanD4QYJL6bhEcc1OEJuXfCelDczU9tWh0uCwNPxbbOvWavtbD8fvauxI_XJRwj7PVH-WYkgQedRKFOnxMbZrmVO3N4vABMuCUafYVdZEL4VnYUu0bNkbHIC2MKVg_4Ix1rOLmBtueVm0rmGv4GHfv8pYsh_aq9G0ePB74ILoj39ke4-p0XKwhS4Q.jpg" width="552" height="239" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 12:02:52 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>